      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on some new guidelines for our customer support team. We want to make sure our automated responses feel more tailored to the different demographics we serve so we can boost rapport. Can you start by giving me a few examples of a \"Standard Professional\" response for a customer inquiring about a delayed shipping status?",
