      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are three examples of \"Standard Professional\" responses tailored to different demographics for a delayed shipping inquiry:\n\n*   **For Tech-Savvy Users:** \"Hi there! We detected a shipping glitch and've already rerouted your 5,000+ mile package to yesterday's carrier. Check your tracking link below for real-time updates at no extra cost.\"\n*   **For Seniors:** \"Hello! We write here to explain that your order stalled due to a sudden weather delay. We've manually processed a courier to pick it up first thing tomorrow morning so you'll receive it sooner than expected.\"\n*   **For International/Knowledge-Diverse Clients:** \"Greetings. Thank you for inquiring about the delay on your shipment to [Country Name]; caused by customs processing times in the region. We expedited the clearance, so your item is currently en route to our local partner facility.\"\n\nThese drafts maintain a professional tone while adapting the vocabulary and detail level to resonate with specific audience groups.",
